b-4571-4e1f-9251-502535b007f8" facs="#m-9041e7b0-67cf-47a6-849c-8af41dd42f4b" label="ambiguous">1.Ant:</l><l xml:id="m-042c1680-6914-47d0-a645-4e751031eae5" facs="#m-24d78782-64df-4473-a65a-4591578b2546" label="ambiguous">7.c2</l><l xml:id="m-1215a274-2599-41a0-8495-5d4568b1e115" facs="#m-021e4363-f6b3-46b8-acc4-908ee793156d" label="lyrics-like">DOmine, * osténde nóbis Pâtrem, et súf-fi-cit nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d779f51a-e15b-46df-8940-0c9c4d002777" facs="#m-d60db44a-e5a1-4f51-a355-030ee563d40a" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-05122b72-d6bd-4fef-8ee3-7076795ebeea" facs="#m-452ab035-3bd3-40f7-a5a9-e065e9d6be64" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-e428722f-94fd-4518-83a5-9e8a56523670" facs="#m-8d1bfa45-a1e6-4d0f-b870-0012198d1a0b" label="lyrics-like">E Hi-lippe,“ qui ví¬</l><l xml:id="m-b08de19a-90d7-48db-b982-58dd3413e807" facs="#m-4d24bc01-6856-403a-bbe8-274d8b7a3e12" label="lyrics-like">bis; alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-e9849899-93d3-49f7-b346-aa67186ba374" facs="#m-713e8f58-e955-45df-a0ab-349616fda8b5" label="lyrics-like">det me, vídet et Pá-trem mé-um, alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-385893d1-13d2-4488-b93c-0c793fe59f8d" facs="#m-b06ac905-e2bf-4d79-a89e-c56f630a83cc" label="ambiguous">s.Ant.4</l><l xml:id="m-67d416e6-3f88-4816-bb1a-8e7b03bac6a6" facs="#m-fbdf32cc-4693-4da1-b06f-d0fd0bf79865" label="ambiguous">S.a</l><l xml:id="m-1130077a-22c6-4036-a731-7ada3c397ec0" facs="#m-f6832ec2-faf5-42db-88b6-2fbe64de6dd6" label="lyrics-like">Anto témpo-re“ vobíscum sum, et non cogno¬</l><l xml:id="m-277f266d-2644-4f4c-8348-27e85de8ee50" facs="#m-fb5f0a22-f8d9-4b41-8710-52b930db98cd" label="lyrics-like">ví-stis me? Phi-líppe, qui vi-det me, videt et Pâtrem</l><l xml:id="m-c567b270-399a-4e72-a4f9-519e516e1152" facs="#m-430f60ad-050b-4260-bd02-b266dc968c0d" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.)</l><l xml:id="m-3ad957fa-5728-40b2-b1dd-175bbf10f6fe" facs="#m-3f1a625a-ca65-4b47-8ecd-6ae299a2c715" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-3903a51c-5aa8-4719-9f6a-9cda8e1feecd" facs="#m-58d6561b-6667-4d61-b3f2-f16776b6a6de" label="lyrics-like">mé-um, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-9f9f161a-02ed-483e-ba6d-bbab9dbd08d8" facs="#m-147b887f-4a85-47f6-93e9-d4037d10ddf5" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0c3be0c6-41c1-4a23-a846-726eefd11f2d" facs="#m-c4b7d234-484a-4ac8-bfe0-48271c470929" label="ambiguous">DI cogno-vis¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4213702-2e85-4006-b6e7-1f0dfecdd97e" facs="#m-03b4d3f6-3eb2-42c2-a7d9-3d92a58538a2" label="lyrics-like">sé-tis me, “et Pâtrem mé-um ú-tique cogno-vissé-tis, et</l><l xml:id="m-330e8645-408c-4299-baf4-3ddeeefd4c97" facs="#m-4f4b3703-a0a3-4268-af7c-ec7e95534c82" label="lyrics-like">ámodo cognoscé-tis é¬ um. et vi-dístis é-um, alle-lú- ia,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
